OL,3,GNEWSCITV to cut #30m in spending as
OL,4,Cadvertising demand weakens
OL,5,
OL,6,FITV is to make #30m of temporary
OL,7,Fsavings in its Media & Entertainment
OL,8,F(M&E) division in the final quarter of
OL,9,Fthe year, after what it described as
OL,10,Fweaker demand for advertising in the
OL,11,Fsecond half of 2026.
OL,13,FThe savings will comprise #25m in
OL,14,Fcontent and #5m in discretionary
OL,15,Fnon-content costs.
OL,23,EPub: 11-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
