OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F142A1794595303
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/6
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV to cut #30m in spending as
OL,4,Cadvertising demand weakens
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe broadcaster's trading update for
OL,7,Fthe nine months to 30th September shows
OL,8,Ftotal advertising revenue (TAR) fell 8%
OL,9,Fyear-on-year in the third quarter. ITV
OL,10,Fnow expects TAR to be down around 5 `
OL,11,F10% in Q4, and down around 2 ` 3% for
OL,12,F2026 as a whole.
OL,14,FITV blamed the downturn on continuing
OL,15,Fmacroeconomic uncertainty, increased
OL,16,Fdigital advertising on global streaming
OL,17,Fplatforms, and the impact of the Less
OL,18,FHealthy Food advertising regulations,
OL,19,Fwhich came into force on 1st October
OL,20,F2025.
OL,23,EPub: 11-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,143,140,200,120,0,100
