OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F142A1794595303
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/6
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV to cut #30m in spending as
OL,4,Cadvertising demand weakens
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts total content budget for 2026 is
OL,7,Fexpected to be around #1.2bn.
OL,9,FChief Executive Carolyn McCall said:
OL,10,F"We are taking decisive action,
OL,11,Faligning our investment with advertiser
OL,12,Fdemand to deliver additional temporary
OL,13,Fcontent and discretionary non-content
OL,14,Fcost savings in Q4."
OL,16,FAcross the nine months, total Group
OL,17,Frevenue was down 1% to #2.76bn, with
OL,18,FTAR also down 1%.
OL,23,EPub: 11-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,143,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14204
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F142A1794595303
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/6
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV to cut #30m in spending as
OL,4,Cadvertising demand weakens
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, digital revenue grew 7% to
OL,7,F#461m and total streaming hours rose
OL,8,F29% to 2.15 billion, with ITV X boosted
OL,9,Fby the final matches of the Football
OL,10,FWorld Cup alongside titles such as
OL,11,FTrigger Point, Big Brother and Love
OL,12,FIsland.
OL,14,FProduction arm ITV Studios saw total
OL,15,Frevenue fall 1% to #1.33bn, which ITV
OL,16,Fsaid was in line with expectations, as
OL,17,Fdeliveries and licensing deals are
OL,18,Fheavily weighted to Q4.
OL,20,FUpcoming deliveries include Line of
OL,21,FDuty series seven for the BBC and
OL,22,FHell's Kitchen for Fox.
OL,23,EPub: 11-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,143,140,200,120,0,100
