SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F142A1794595303
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/6
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV to cut #30m in spending as
OL,4,Cadvertising demand weakens
OL,5,
OL,6,FITV Studios also produced five of the
OL,7,FUK's top ten most-watched dramas in Q3,
OL,8,Fincluding The Blame, which ITV says is
OL,9,Fthe most-watched drama of the year so
OL,10,Ffar.
OL,12,FITV still expects ITV Studios to
OL,13,Fdeliver good revenue growth over the
OL,14,Ffull year, with its profit margin at
OL,15,Fthe lower end of the 13% to 15% range.
OL,16,FIt also says it remains on track for
OL,17,Fcontinued profitable digital revenue
OL,18,Fgrowth in M&E.
OL,23,EPub: 11-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
