OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G6/6
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCITV to cut #30m in spending as
OL,4,Cadvertising demand weakens
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, the agreed sale of ITV's M&E
OL,7,Fbusiness to Sky is "progressing as
OL,8,Fplanned" ITV says. The Secretary of
OL,9,FState issued a Public Interest
OL,10,FIntervention Notice on 4th November,
OL,11,Fwhich ITV described as an expected
OL,12,Fmilestone in the regulatory review, and
OL,13,Fcompletion is still expected in the
OL,14,Fsecond half of 2027.
OL,23,EPub: 11-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
